---
--- A fourth table for the same reason the other three are separate: this art is
--- uploaded by hand from `assets/badges/`, not regenerated by
--- `scripts/upload_assets.py`, and keeping it out of `Assets` means the icon
--- generator cannot overwrite an id it did not create.
---
--- Same rule as `GamepassIcons`: these are **Image** asset ids. A Decal id
--- fails silently as an empty frame, which is indistinguishable from missing
--- art at runtime.
